# Exception: indexnow-ping.mjs is COPY'd by the runner stage of Dockerfile
# (added 2026-07-05 for the IndexNow deploy ping). Without this negation,
# Kaniko fails with "copy failed: no source files specified" — see
# failed DO deployment 26906b0d-28a9-4264-b610-e3a56a627311.
!scripts/indexnow-ping.mjs
.env.example
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
CREDENTIAL_UPDATE_LOG.md
FINAL_MIGRATION_LOG.md

# === Build-context slimming (2026-08-12) ===
# Stage 1b (`srcguard`) does a bare `COPY . .`, so EVERY root-level file lands
# in a kaniko snapshot — and kaniko holds snapshot state in RAM out of the same
# fixed 8 vCPU / 15 GiB budget the Next.js build needs. These are QA/audit
# artifacts (~3 MB of PNGs alone) that no build stage ever reads.
# NOTE: patterns without a slash match ROOT level only, so nested assets under
# public/ and assets/public-runtime/ are untouched.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
.screenshots
test_reports
docs
uploads
dump.rdb
debug_output.txt
page_errors.txt
backend_test*
test_*.js
test_*.ts
*_test.js
*_test.ts
.husky
.github
.do

# === Archived one-off scripts/reports from past sessions ===
_archive
